  "goodToKnow": "Abtragen has several meanings: to remove or level gradually (einen Hügel, eine Mauer abtragen; erosion trägt Gestein ab), to pay off debts bit by bit (Schulden abtragen), and to wear clothes until they're worn out: abgetragene Schuhe. Younger siblings often have to die Kleidung der Älteren abtragen (wear hand-me-downs). Separable and irregular: trug ab, abgetragen."
